        "created_at": "2012-05-20T21:10:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well, racist means carrying hatred, so if they don’t meant to be racist then they aren’t.</p>\n<p>If anything, it makes you the racist one, because you are the one associating it with a race, then declaring that being associated with said race is a negative.</p>",
