        "created_at": "2012-05-20T21:59:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;flamethrower49&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"flamethrower49\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Well, this is a good way to either bring a thread to a screeching halt, or send it in a direction that we really do not need to see.</p>\n<p>I’ve lived in an inner-city environment my whole life, and have heard the word used in that sense many times, by people of all races.  I’ve never heard anybody take offense to it, but after thinking about it, I can certainly see how you might.  This debate does not belong here.  Can we cool off before a fight starts?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Happy to cool off.</p>\n<p>And loving the irony of a potential flame war being cooled down by someone with the handle flamethrower.</p>",
