        "created_at": "2012-05-22T13:17:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My core and Rook City cards are sleeved using Fantasy Flight sleeves, and holy hell I love those things. They’re thick and/but really nice. I have my playtest stuff in Ultra Pro sleeves of various colors to stand out, and… they just remind me how much nicer the FFG ones are, in my opinion. I even went nuts and bought all the sleeves needed for when Infernal Relics is released! I’m just that dedicated. Or insane. I forget which.</p>",
